{
  "transcript": {
    "duration": 305.17,
    "segments": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 2.55,
        "text": "Hello, sir; bataiye kya dekhna tha."
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 3.95,
        "end": 12.700000000000001,
        "text": "Wo display wala Lenovo laptop chahiye, sixteen GB RAM wala; online price dekha tha, yahan kitne ka hai?"
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 13.9,
        "end": 23.549999999999997,
        "text": "Ji, ye sola GB RAM aur panch so bara GB s s d wala hai. Final price artalis hazar nau so nabbe hai, g s t included."
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 24.842,
        "end": 27.392,
        "text": "Theek hai, sealed piece milega na,"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 28.292,
        "end": 36.142,
        "text": "display wala nahi chahiye. Haan sir, seal stock hai, aapke saamne kholenge, serial number bhi bill se match kar lena."
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 37.242000000000004,
        "end": 40.042,
        "text": "Achha, ek piece nikal dijiye,"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 40.992000000000004,
        "end": 41.692,
        "text": "yahi lena hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 42.742000000000004,
        "end": 47.592,
        "text": "Sir, iske saath laptop bag aur wireless mouse ka bundle le sakte ho."
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 48.252,
        "end": 59.402,
        "text": "अलक लोवे तो बैग एक हजार चारसो और माॉस आपसो का है। लैपटाप के साथ दोनों मिला के एक हजार पंद्रा पडेंगे। टोटल पचास हजार चारसो नब्बे हो जाएगा।"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 59.402,
        "end": 64.402,
        "text": "बैग दिखाओ जरा लैपटॉप फिट हो जाएगा और पैडिंग है इसमें"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 65.452,
        "end": 66.452,
        "text": "जी य"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 67.552,
        "end": 76.46,
        "text": "अंदर पैडेड लैपटाप कंपार्टमेंट है, इस मॉडल का साइस आराम से फिट हो जाएगा। Maus ke saath USB receiver bhi aata hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 77.21,
        "end": 82.96,
        "text": "Haan, bag theek hai, mouse bhi kaam aayega. pandra sau mein dono add kar do."
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 83.81,
        "end": 90.25999999999999,
        "text": "Bilkul, sir. Laptop, bag aur mouse mila ke pachas hazaar chaar sau nabbe. Bill kis naam se banaun?"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 91.46,
        "end": 94.16,
        "text": "Rahul Sharma. Payment card se karoonga."
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 95.35999999999999,
        "end": 97.41,
        "text": "Bundle ka discount bill mein dikhega na?"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 98.51,
        "end": 98.81,
        "text": "जी,"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 99.36,
        "end": 107.61000000000001,
        "text": "accessories का साथ सौर रुपए discount बिल में दिखेगा. पहले sealed box और model check कर लीजे फिर payment कर लेंगे."
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 108.71000000000001,
        "end": 114.46000000000001,
        "text": "हाँ, model सही है और seal भी ठीक है. चलिए billing कर दीजे."
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 122.16,
        "end": 123.86,
        "text": "जी, बताईए."
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 125.044,
        "end": 125.944,
        "text": "क्या दिखाऊँ?"
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 126.494,
        "end": 132.094,
        "text": "लैपटॉप के लिए तार वाला माउस चाहिए। पाँच सौ के अंदर दिखाना।"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 132.644,
        "end": 138.344,
        "text": "ये वाला साड़हे चार सौ का है, साधारण यू एस बी वाला है, लगाते ही चल जाएगा."
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 139.644,
        "end": 141.29399999999998,
        "text": "तार कितना लंबा है इसका?"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 142.594,
        "end": 146.144,
        "text": "डेड़ मीटर है, डिब्बे पर भी लिखा है, ये देखिये."
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 147.04399999999998,
        "end": 150.29399999999998,
        "text": "हाँ, इतना ठीक है, यही दे दो।"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 151.054,
        "end": 159.754,
        "text": "वैसे आप सोमी ये बिना तार वाला भी है, तीन सौ पचास और लगेंगे, मेज पर तार का झंझट नहीं रहेगा, वो कर दूं?"
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 160.954,
        "end": 166.004,
        "text": "नहीं भैया, पाँच सो से ऊपर नहीं जाना। तार वाला ही चाहिये।"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 166.704,
        "end": 174.804,
        "text": "समझ गया, पर एक बार हाथ में पकड़ कर देख लीजिये, पकड़ भी अच्छी है, लैपटौप के साथ ले जाना आसान रहेगा."
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 176.206,
        "end": 182.65599999999998,
        "text": "अरे नहीं, बोला ना, रोज इस्तिमाल भी नहीं करना है। साढहे चार सौ वाला निकालो बस।"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 183.65599999999998,
        "end": 188.256,
        "text": "जी, ठीक है, माफ़ कीजिए, यही वाला निकाल देता हूँ।"
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 189.15599999999998,
        "end": 195.206,
        "text": "पैक करने से पहले चला कर दिखा देना दोनों बटन और बीच वाला पहिया भी।"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 195.90599999999998,
        "end": 204.45999999999998,
        "text": "बिलकुल, ये देखिए, दोनों बटन चल रहे हैं और पन्ना ऊपर नीचे भी हो रहा है। Bil samt sahi char sau hi hai."
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 205.41,
        "end": 209.10999999999999,
        "text": "Theek hai, ye paise lo, bil dibbe mein rakh dena."
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "speaker": "B",
        "start": 217.20999999999998,
        "end": 219.45999999999998,
        "text": "Hello sir,"
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 221.31,
        "end": 226.81,
        "text": "I need a basic wired mouse for my laptop, something under five hundred rupees."
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 227.964,
        "end": 233.464,
        "text": "Yes, this one is three hundred ninety nine rupees. It has a regular u_s_b_ connection."
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 234.264,
        "end": 239.964,
        "text": "That should be fine; my laptop has the normal u_s_b_ port. Can I see it?"
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "speaker": "A",
        "start": 241.364,
        "end": 245.41400000000002,
        "text": "Sure, here is the display piece. You can check the size and grip."
      },
      {
        "id": 39,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 246.964,
        "end": 253.114,
        "text": "The size is comfortable. Can you connect it once, so I can check the clicks?"
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 253.998,
        "end": 259.448,
        "text": "Certainly; I've connected it to this laptop. Please try both buttons and the scroll wheel."
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 260.348,
        "end": 264.198,
        "text": "Yes! it's working properly; I'll take one."
      },
      {
        "id": 42,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 265.848,
        "end": 268.948,
        "text": "Okay, I'll get a sealed box of the same model."
      },
      {
        "id": 43,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 269.848,
        "end": 273.14799999999997,
        "text": "Your total is three hundred ninety nine rupees, including tax."
      },
      {
        "id": 44,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 274.64799999999997,
        "end": 276.64799999999997,
        "text": "Can I pay by u p i?"
      },
      {
        "id": 45,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 277.448,
        "end": 280.598,
        "text": "Yes; please scan this qr code at the counter."
      },
      {
        "id": 46,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 281.812,
        "end": 287.462,
        "text": "Done!--it shows successful! Please give me the bill also."
      },
      {
        "id": 47,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 288.612,
        "end": 292.312,
        "text": "Payment received, sir; here are your mouse and the printed bill."
      },
      {
        "id": 48,
        "speaker": "C",
        "start": 293.612,
        "end": 295.012,
        "text": "Great, thank you!"
      }
    ],
